"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\" data-focus-id=\"skip-navigation\">Skip to content</a><div class=\"shell\"><header class=\"site-header\" data-focus-id=\"portfolio-header\"><div class=\"header-inner\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\" aria-label=\"Jérôme Schaeffer — Home\" data-focus-id=\"home-brand\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">js.</span><span class=\"brand-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"brand-name\">Jérôme Schaeffer</span><span class=\"brand-role\">Senior product engineer</span></span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Portfolio sections\"><a href=\"#work/3i\" data-nav=\"work\" data-focus-id=\"nav-work\">Work</a><a href=\"#about\" data-nav=\"about\" data-focus-id=\"nav-about\">About</a><a href=\"#playground\" data-nav=\"playground\" data-focus-id=\"nav-playground\">AI demo</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><span class=\"location\">Seoul <time id=\"seoul-time\"></time></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button header-resume\" data-dialog=\"resume\" data-focus-id=\"header-resume\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Résumé</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline contact-link\" data-dialog=\"contact\" data-focus-id=\"persistent-contact\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Let’s talk</button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-focus-id=\"portfolio-main\">\n<section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-home\" aria-labelledby=\"home-title\" data-focus-id=\"home\"><div class=\"home-grid\">\n<div class=\"hero-copy\" data-reveal><p class=\"eyebrow\">Senior product engineer · Seoul</p><h1 class=\"hello\" id=\"home-title\" data-focus-id=\"personal-heading\"><span class=\"hello-intro\">Hi, I’m</span> <span class=\"hero-name\">Jérôme</span> <span class=\"surname\">Schaeffer.</span></h1><p class=\"intro\">I build the experience.<br>And what makes it work.</p><p class=\"intro-detail\">11+ years across frontend, full-stack and AI/AX work: product interfaces, backend systems, 3D viewers and the AI tools teams use. I connect the work people see with the systems and collaboration behind it.</p><div class=\"home-actions\"><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"#work/3i/beamo/overview?filter=professional\" data-focus-id=\"home-selected-work\">Explore professional work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#playground\" data-focus-id=\"home-approach\">Try the AI demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div>\n<figure class=\"home-person\" data-reveal data-focus-id=\"home-portrait\"><div class=\"portrait-composition\" id=\"portrait-composition\"><img class=\"person-portrait\" src=\"/assets/jerome-portrait.jpeg\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Black-and-white portrait of Jérôme Schaeffer\"></div><figcaption><span class=\"person-note\">Based in Seoul.<br>Experience across France, Luxembourg &amp; Korea.</span><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#about\" data-focus-id=\"home-about\">A little more about me <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></figcaption></figure>\n<nav class=\"home-selection\" data-reveal aria-labelledby=\"home-selection-label\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"home-selection-label\">Selected professional experience</p><ul><li><a href=\"#work/3i\" data-project=\"3i\" data-focus-id=\"home-3i\"><span class=\"selection-company\">3i</span><span class=\"selection-role\">Frontend Developer &amp; AX Engineer</span><span class=\"selection-scope\">Beamo · Pivo · AI/AX</span><span class=\"selection-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#work/enhans\" data-project=\"enhans\" data-focus-id=\"home-enhans\"><span class=\"selection-company\">Enhans</span><span class=\"selection-role\">Frontend Developer</span><span class=\"selection-scope\">AI products · LLM agents · ACT-1</span><span class=\"selection-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#work/rubiwin\" data-project=\"rubiwin\" data-focus-id=\"home-rubiwin\"><span class=\"selection-company\">Redspher</span><span class=\"selection-role\">Full-stack Developer &amp; Team Lead</span><span class=\"selection-scope\">Rubiwin &amp; Supplier Portal</span><span class=\"selection-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></li></ul></nav>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-work\" aria-labelledby=\"work-title\" data-focus-id=\"selected-work\" hidden><header class=\"page-head work-head\" data-reveal><h2 id=\"work-title\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-focus-id=\"work-heading\">Work</h2></header>\n<div class=\"work-rail\"><nav class=\"workplaces\" aria-label=\"Featured workplaces and side projects\" id=\"workplaces\" data-focus-id=\"project-index\"></nav><a class=\"full-career-link\" href=\"#about/career\">Full career · 7 companies since 2015 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"work-context\" id=\"work-context\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"work-directory\" hidden><span id=\"work-context-path\"></span><strong>Switch ▾</strong></button>\n<dialog class=\"work-directory\" id=\"work-directory\" aria-labelledby=\"directory-title\"><header><h3 id=\"directory-title\">Switch project</h3><button type=\"button\" id=\"directory-close\" autofocus>Close</button></header><nav aria-label=\"Work directory\" id=\"directory-links\"></nav><a class=\"full-career-link\" href=\"#about/career\">Full career · 7 companies since 2015 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></dialog>\n<article class=\"case\" id=\"project-story\" aria-labelledby=\"inspector-title\" data-focus-id=\"project-inspector\"><header class=\"case-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"inspector-meta\"></p><h3 id=\"inspector-title\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-focus-id=\"project-heading\"></h3><p class=\"case-role-line\"><span id=\"inspector-role\"></span><span id=\"case-stack\"></span></p></header>\n<nav class=\"product-picker\" aria-labelledby=\"product-list-title\"><h4 id=\"product-list-title\"></h4><ul class=\"project-list\" id=\"project-list\"></ul></nav>\n<figure class=\"case-figure\" data-focus-id=\"project-visual-column\"><header class=\"view-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"view-owner\"></p><h4 id=\"view-title\" tabindex=\"-1\"></h4></header><div class=\"view-tabs\" id=\"visual-chapters\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Project views\"></div><div class=\"visual-stage\" id=\"visual-stage\" data-focus-id=\"project-visual\"></div><figcaption class=\"visual-text\"><span class=\"visual-annotation\" id=\"visual-annotation\" data-focus-id=\"visual-annotation\"></span><span class=\"visual-caption\" id=\"visual-caption\"></span></figcaption></figure>\n<section class=\"case-did\" aria-labelledby=\"case-did-title\"><h4 class=\"section-label\" id=\"case-did-title\">What I did</h4><ul class=\"did-list\" id=\"case-did\"></ul></section>\n<details class=\"case-more\" id=\"case-more\" data-focus-id=\"case-more\"><summary data-focus-id=\"case-more-toggle\"><span class=\"more-text\"><span class=\"more-title\" id=\"more-title\">Read the full case</span><span class=\"more-hint\">Context · My role · Product detail · Sources</span></span><span class=\"more-toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"case-sections\"><section class=\"case-section\" id=\"case-overview\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"case-overview-title\"><p class=\"section-label\">Context</p><div class=\"case-section-body\"><h4 id=\"case-overview-title\"></h4><p id=\"case-overview-meta\"></p><ul class=\"case-highlights\" id=\"case-highlights\" aria-label=\"Highlights\"></ul><div id=\"case-overview-body\"></div></div></section><section class=\"case-section\" id=\"case-role\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"case-role-title\"><p class=\"section-label\">My role</p><div class=\"case-section-body\"><h4 id=\"case-role-title\"></h4><div id=\"case-role-body\"></div></div></section><section class=\"case-section\" id=\"case-decisions\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"case-decisions-title\"><p class=\"section-label\">Product detail</p><div class=\"case-section-body\"><h4 id=\"case-decisions-title\"></h4><div id=\"case-decisions-body\"></div></div></section><section class=\"case-section\" id=\"case-sources\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"case-sources-title\"><p class=\"section-label\">Sources</p><div class=\"case-section-body\"><h4 id=\"case-sources-title\">Sources &amp; product links</h4><div id=\"case-sources-body\"></div></div></section></div></details>\n<a class=\"case-approach\" id=\"case-approach\" data-focus-id=\"case-approach\" href=\"#playground\" hidden></a>\n<nav class=\"case-pager\" aria-label=\"More projects\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline\" id=\"previous-project\" data-focus-id=\"previous-project\"></button><span class=\"pager-position\" id=\"project-position\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline\" id=\"next-project\" data-focus-id=\"next-project\"></button></nav></article></section>\n<section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-playground\" aria-labelledby=\"approach-title\" data-focus-id=\"decision-playground\" hidden><header class=\"page-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">AI demo</p><h2 id=\"approach-title\" data-focus-id=\"approach-heading\">Where should AI stop?</h2></div><p class=\"page-note\">I start with the need, shape a useful interaction, and decide where a person stays in control.</p></header>\n<div class=\"evaluation-layout\"><form id=\"decision-form\" class=\"situation-panel\" novalidate data-focus-id=\"situation-form\"><div class=\"example-launcher\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start with an example · make it yours</p><div class=\"example-cards\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Example situations\"><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"inbox\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>Translation draft</strong><small>Refine the tone</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"access\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>Agent action</strong><small>Change a shared file</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-example=\"refund\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><strong>Carrier pricing</strong><small>Suggest an offer</small></button></div></div><div class=\"situation-label\"><label for=\"situation\">Bring your own situation.</label><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-button\" id=\"clear-situation\" data-focus-id=\"clear-situation\">Clear</button></div><textarea id=\"situation\" name=\"situation\" rows=\"5\" maxlength=\"1200\" minlength=\"10\" aria-describedby=\"situation-help character-count situation-error\" placeholder=\"For example: an AI assistant drafts a reply to a customer, but a person reviews it before sending…\" data-focus-id=\"situation-input\"></textarea><div class=\"input-meta\"><span id=\"situation-help\">A hypothetical product decision. 10–1,200 characters.</span><output id=\"character-count\" for=\"situation\">0 / 1,200</output></div><p id=\"situation-error\" class=\"input-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n<select id=\"scenario\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"><option value=\"\">Choose an example…</option><option value=\"inbox\">Refine a translation</option><option value=\"access\">Let an agent act</option><option value=\"refund\">Suggest a carrier price</option></select>\n<fieldset class=\"decision-constraints\"><legend>Optional constraints <span>Explore the trade-off</span></legend><div class=\"constraint-grid\"><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"ambiguity\">Ambiguity</label><output id=\"ambiguity-label\" for=\"ambiguity\">Medium</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"ambiguity\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"ambiguity-control\"></div><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"consequences\">Consequences</label><output id=\"consequences-label\" for=\"consequences\">Medium</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"consequences\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"consequences-control\"></div><div class=\"constraint\"><div class=\"constraint-top\"><label for=\"reversibility\">Reversibility</label><output id=\"reversibility-label\" for=\"reversibility\">Partly reversible</output></div><input type=\"range\" id=\"reversibility\" min=\"0\" max=\"2\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" data-focus-id=\"reversibility-control\"></div></div></fieldset>\n<p class=\"send-note\" id=\"send-note\">Your situation and constraints are sent to OpenAI when you evaluate. Use fictional situations. No actions are executed.</p><div class=\"evaluate-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" id=\"evaluate-situation\" class=\"button button-primary\" aria-describedby=\"send-note\" data-focus-id=\"evaluate-situation\">Evaluate situation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"cancel-evaluation\" class=\"button button-outline\" data-focus-id=\"cancel-evaluation\" hidden>Cancel request</button></div></form>\n<aside class=\"evaluation-result\" id=\"evaluation-result\" aria-label=\"Evaluation result\" aria-busy=\"false\" data-focus-id=\"evaluation-result\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">OpenAI / Decision</p><div id=\"evaluation-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"><h3 id=\"ai-choice\">Your situation.<br>A considered boundary.</h3><p id=\"ai-status\">Describe what AI might do, what could go wrong, and where a person is involved. Then evaluate when you’re ready.</p></div><div class=\"ai-bars\" id=\"ai-bars\" aria-label=\"Model probabilities\" hidden></div><p id=\"ai-note\" class=\"result-note\" hidden></p><div class=\"category-reading\" id=\"category-reading\" hidden><p class=\"eyebrow\">How to read this category</p><p id=\"category-meaning\"></p><small>General interpretation, not model reasoning.</small></div><a class=\"text-link example-return\" id=\"example-return\" href=\"#work/3i\" data-focus-id=\"return-to-case\">Explore professional work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></aside></div></section>\n<section class=\"stage\" id=\"stage-about\" aria-labelledby=\"about-title\" data-focus-id=\"career-about\" hidden><header class=\"page-head\" data-reveal><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">About</p><h2 id=\"about-title\" data-focus-id=\"career-heading\">A little more about me.</h2></div><p class=\"page-note\">A career across products, systems and people.</p></header>\n<div class=\"about-layout\"><div class=\"about-person\" data-reveal data-focus-id=\"about-introduction\"><img class=\"person-portrait\" src=\"/assets/jerome-portrait.jpeg\" width=\"960\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Black-and-white portrait of Jérôme Schaeffer\"><p>I’m based in Seoul, with experience in France, Luxembourg and Korea.</p><p>I’ve built across frontend, backend and AI, led teams, and taught web development. Each part gives me a wider view of what it takes to deliver a product.</p></div><ol class=\"career-list\" id=\"chapter-list\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Full career\" data-reveal></ol></div>\n<div class=\"career-footer\"><p>Based in Seoul. Connecting the product interface to the systems and people behind it.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline\" data-dialog=\"resume\" data-focus-id=\"resume-information\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-controls=\"detail-dialog\">Read my résumé <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></section></main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\" data-focus-id=\"persistent-navigation\"><div class=\"footer-inner\"><p class=\"footer-note\">Frontend, backend, AI. Made with curiosity.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"motion-toggle\" id=\"motion-toggle\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-focus-id=\"motion-toggle\"><span class=\"motion-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span id=\"motion-label\">Motion on</span></button></div></footer></div><dialog id=\"detail-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" data-focus-id=\"context-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"dialog-label\">Let’s connect</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-button\" id=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-focus-id=\"close-dialog\">×</button></div><div class=\"dialog-body\" id=\"dialog-body\"></div></dialog><dialog id=\"image-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"lightbox-title\" aria-describedby=\"lightbox-caption\" data-focus-id=\"image-lightbox\"><div class=\"lightbox-toolbar\"><h2 id=\"lightbox-title\" data-focus-id=\"image-title\">Product image</h2><div class=\"lightbox-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"button button-outline\" id=\"image-size\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-focus-id=\"image-size\">Actual size</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-button\" id=\"image-close\" aria-label=\"Close image\" data-focus-id=\"close-image\">×</button></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-viewport\" id=\"lightbox-viewport\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Product image; scroll when viewing actual size\"><img id=\"lightbox-image\" src=\"/assets/translater-product.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Translater entry screen\"></div><p class=\"lightbox-caption\" id=\"lightbox-caption\">Actual product image.</p></dialog><div class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"stage-announcement\"></div><noscript><p class=\"no-js\">This interactive portfolio needs JavaScript. Read my <a href=\"/assets/resume-en.pdf\">English résumé</a> or <a href=\"/assets/resume-ko.pdf\">한국어 이력서</a>, or <a href=\"mailto:jer.schaeffer@gmail.com\">email me</a>.</p></noscript>"
